          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entumwa yaagira Daudi eti: Abantu baayo batubingire, baatuhitsya omu ishwa ahi tubaire turi, kwonka naitwe twababainga, twarugaho twabahitsya omu irembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abarasi abaabaire beemereire aha rugo baarasha abairu baawe; mbwenu bamwe aha bagaragwa b'omugabe bafiire, Omuhiiti yaabafamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaagira egyo ntumwa ati: oku nikwo oraagire Yoabu oti: Ekyo kirekye kukugwisa kubi; ahakubi rurara eita omuntu, obundi eita ondiijo. Yeyongyere kuhamya orugamba; orwane n'orurembo, orusingure. Kandi naiwe, ku oraakikyeyo, omugumye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
